    (date "2026-08-01")
    (rev "A")
    (comment 1 "Six contact buttons + push-to-talk on one MCP23017 at 0x20")
    (comment 2 "Port A reads switches (pull-ups internal); port B sinks lamps")
    (comment 3 "Lamps are ACTIVE LOW: anode to +5V via R, cathode to GPBn")
    (comment 4 "Do not fit I2C pull-ups - the Pi already has 1.8k on SDA/SCL")
